[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0010","text":"────……这里是这样……\n咚、咚、咚"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0020","text":"明白了，谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0030","text":"圆香同学和雏菜同学不在的时候学的\n就是这些对吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0040","text":"是这样啊～\n雏菜有时候也来了，很快就能跟上的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0050","text":"嗯、嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0060","text":"那回去吧\n天也黑了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0070","text":"等……\n……等、等一下……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0080","text":"制作人跟我说了……\n但是……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0090","text":"────我，如果圆香同学退出noctchill的话……\n我、我不要……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0100","text":"……好不容易才让大家一起进了同一个组合……\n我又要，一个人────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0110","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0120","text":"我和小糸不一样\n不可能每次都接住你的情绪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0130","text":"……又不是手牵着手走路\n也不可能永远走在同一条路上"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0140","text":"就这点事，我们的关系也不会改变\n青梅竹马不就是这样的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0150","text":"但是……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0160","text":"────对、对啊……如果她有想走的路\n就该支持她……不能妨碍她……对吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0170","text":"我、我一个人也能行的，noctchill……！\n我会在大家能聚齐的地方，一直待着……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0180","text":"……圆香同学，对不起……！\n我……，……不……加、加油啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0190","text":"诶～？\n圆香前辈要退出noctchill了吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_06_0200","text":"……"}]
